upon like racing, right?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.430
- I don't know, you got
your pink slip with you?

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:15.040
I assume that yellow is
not a streak up your back

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.030
and you're willing to line these up.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.190
- Oh I, you know what?

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.990
Sunny is about to take you down, sir.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.200
- Okay, well, let's fire 'em up, sister.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.260
- All right, well, good luck.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.270
If I'll see you at the
drive-in later after you,

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.103
after my dust.

00:05:26.103 --> 00:05:27.960
- I'll see you in my rear view mirror.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:28.793
- Whatever.

00:05:28.793 --> 00:05:31.870
(truck starter croaking)

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.247
Do you you hear that engine?

00:05:33.247 --> 00:05:36.080
(engines revving)

00:05:38.547 --> 00:05:39.380
Bye!

00:05:46.311 --> 00:05:48.226
